# Drought's "black mana symbol" names a color with a color word of its text, which Sleight of Mind changes (CR 612.2): once
# both its "black"s are "red", Bot2's Drowned "{B}: Regenerate" keeps Bot2's Swamp on turn 2, its Dark Ritual ({B}) keeps
# the Swamp on turn 4, and its red Lightning Bolt then takes it. Bot1 pays the upkeep {W}{W} on turn 3.
